WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.080
Use Timeline in All Tickets when the date of a report is a better clue than its title.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:09.110
Read the date headings, then the ticket title and status within a group.

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:10.650
Open the matching item.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:14.950
For changes made after creation, switch to the ticket's Activity tab.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.470
The queue timeline groups tickets; Activity explains the history of one ticket.
